[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":93},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_43":44,"_45":46,"_47":48,"_49":50,"_51":52,"_53":54,"_55":37,"_56":37,"_57":58,"_59":37,"_60":61},"expiresAt",1795740045000,"id","rnu00kwyfy4hd4up9l1g3ft2s","title","CISA 将 Perforce Puppet RCE 漏洞 CVE-2026-115731 列入 KEV 目录","originalTitle","Hackers Exploiting Critical Puppet RCE Flaw Affecting Enterprise Management Servers","summary","CISA 已将 Perforce Puppet 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-115731 列入 KEV 目录，CVSS 9.4，并称已有在野利用报告。攻击者持任意 CA 签发的代理证书即可通过 PUT 请求提交特制 rich-data 报告，以服务用户权限执行代码；若 CA 自动签发请求且缺少强校验，未经身份验证的攻击者也可利用。","reason","该漏洞已进入 CISA KEV 目录并有公开披露后遭利用的报告，读者可结合受影响版本和修复版本判断处置优先级。","source",{"_73":92},"links",{"_83":91},"publishedAt","2026-11-18T08:24:31.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-18T10:40:32.832Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[88,74,89,77,90],"score",76,"selected",true,"channel","news","story",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"x","readingMode","full","author","info@thehackernews.com (The Hacker News)","body",{"_61":82,"_83":-5,"_84":85,"_86":87},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[78],"topics",[68,69,70],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group",{"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67},"hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh","factId","fZP3_QN_WrgM","reportCount",3,"additionalSourceCount",2,{"_71":76,"_73":77},{"_71":31,"_73":75},{"_71":72,"_73":74},"slug","exploited","name","在野利用","漏洞披露","cisa","CISA",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"publicId","e99515d0-012b-4533-8fe7-2a03e4a5f456","Puppet高危反序列化漏洞已遭在野利用","<p><span><i></i><span>Ravie Lakshmanan</span><i></i><span>2026年11月18日</span></span><span>企业安全 / 漏洞</span></p><p><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhoFKMFLPbzyM7RGi89XdpVFUfFqLH2C0QnAIyZfTSZIkvQNT8jhFEdMdW3D1qPXE0MjtV-q8fM1Alicz0wEuNJ6fnIjOs3BY8D7ABBRWNqPg6NGz9FjhbSQhapwUDZPDyg3kJEy9CZeUwbcmZ3N5nCU8bH6bkCo4BgLfhlE3R3AdDi9CvLVgjqlMW42Pm2/s900/puppet.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/dailyinfo/media/8a65b41073e9f7be.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"320\"></a></p><p>The U.S. Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) on Tuesday <a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/11/17/cisa-adds-one-known-exploited-vulnerability-catalog\">added</a> a critical security flaw impacting <b>Perforce Puppet</b>, an enterprise infrastructure-as-code (IaC) and configuration management platform, to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (<a href=\"https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog\">KEV</a>) catalog, citing reports of active exploitation.</p><p>该漏洞编号为<strong>CVE-2026-115731</strong>（CVSS 分数：9.4），属于对不可信数据进行反序列化的问题，可能导致远程代码执行。</p><p>CISA 表示：“Perforce Puppet Enterprise 的 Puppet 报告处理代码中存在一个对不可信数据进行反序列化的漏洞，允许持有任意由 CA 签发的代理证书的客户端，通过 PUT 请求提交包含特制 rich-data 类型的报告，以服务用户身份在 Puppet Server 上执行任意代码。”</p><p>“如果证书颁发机构自动签署请求而未进行严格验证，未经身份验证的网络攻击者便能获取有效证书并利用该漏洞。”</p><p>该缺陷<a href=\"https://portal.perforce.com/s/cve/a91Qi000003IaHpIAK/report-deserialization-code-execution\">影响</a>以下版本 -</p><ul>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2026.0.0 之前的 2026.0.1</li>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2025.0.0 之前的 2025.12.1</li>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2023.8.0 之前的 2023.8.13</li>\n  <li>Puppet Core 9.0.0 之前的 9.1.3</li>\n  <li>Puppet Core 8.x 之前的 8.22.2</li>\n</ul><p>Perforce Software 已于 2026年11月3日 在以下版本中修复了该问题 -</p><ul>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2026.0.1（Puppet Core 9.1.3）</li>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2025.12.1（Puppet Core 8.22.2）</li>\n  <li>Puppet Enterprise 2023.8.13（Puppet Core 8.22.2）</li>\n  <li>Puppet Core 9.1.3</li>\n  <li>Puppet Core 8.22.2</li>\n</ul><p>值得注意的是，该问题还影响 Puppet 的开源实现 <a href=\"https://voxpupuli.org/blog/2026/11/03/critical-cve-updates/\">OpenVox</a>，并已在以下版本中<a href=\"https://github.com/OpenVoxProject/openvox/security/advisories/GHSA-ffr6-rwpm-p5wq\">修复</a> -</p><ul>\n  <li>OpenVox Agent 9.3.0 和 8.32.0</li>\n  <li>OpenVox Server 9.2.0 和 8.18.0</li>\n</ul><p>Neodyme AG 安全研究员 Alain Rödel 因发现并报告 CVE-2026-115731 以及 CVE-2026-115732（CVSS 分数：9.0）而获得致谢。后者是一个影响 <a href=\"https://portal.perforce.com/s/cve/a91Qi000003IaJRIA0/certificate-name-authorization-bypass\">Puppet</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/OpenVoxProject/trapperkeeper-authorization/security/advisories/GHSA-q4hm-33rc-572g\">OpenVox</a> 的严重证书名称授权绕过问题。这家德国网络安全公司补充称，这些问题是在人工智能（AI）辅助和精确引导下发现的。</p><p>Neodyme 在本月发布的报告中<a href=\"https://neodyme.io/en/blog/puppet_rce/\">表示</a>：“其影响在很大程度上取决于 Puppet 服务器的配置以及所使用的编排协议，以及是否启用了这些协议。”“无论配置如何，能够在 Puppet 服务器上实现 RCE 的攻击者都可以获取 CA 签名密钥并冒充其他主机。”</p><p>“Puppet 是一款功能强大的软件，通常拥有对企业网络中整个系统集群的完全访问权限。在此类核心且重要的系统上实现远程代码执行，可能导致最坏情况：部署勒索软件、大规模数据外泄，以及可能向网络其他部分横向移动。”</p><p>截至撰写时，尚无该漏洞如何在野外被武器化的详细信息。不过，一名为 transdimensia 的 Reddit 用户在 11月4日 的帖子中指出，该漏洞在公开披露后不久便遭到利用。</p><p>该用户<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/Puppet/comments/1xnj0v1/cve2026115732_published_114_being_exploited_in/\">表示</a>：“在我的系统集群中发现一个配置严重不当的 CA 后，我反向追踪了 [CVE-2026-]115731 入侵过程中的活动。”</p><p>建议联邦文职行政部门（FCEB）各机构根据《约束性行动指令（BOD）26-04：基于风险优先处理安全更新》，在 2026 年 12 月 1 日前应用相关修复，以保护其网络。</p><p>觉得这篇文章有意思？请在 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/publications/CAAqLQgKIidDQklTRndnTWFoTUtFWFJvWldoaFkydGxjbTVsZDNNdVkyOXRLQUFQAQ\">Google News</a>、<a href=\"https://twitter.com/thehackersnews\">Twitter</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/thehackernews/\">LinkedIn</a> 上关注我们，阅读我们发布的更多独家内容。</p>","original","zhKind","translation","complete",false,"漏洞","补丁","网络设备","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploiting-critical-puppet-rce.html","The Hacker News",{"_94":95,"_96":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
